<title>EGYPT: Egypt overall index up at seventh straight high.</title>
<headline>Egypt overall index up at seventh straight high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index closed on Monday 0.83 percent higher at 362.61 points, its seventh record high in as many days, the Capital Market Authority said.</p>
<p>The index closed on Sunday at 359.64 points, its sixth straight high.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
